			"notes": "# HudFabric 1.0.6\n\nThis compatibility and reliability update adds Minecraft 26.3 and makes the\nJump Reset Indicator much more precise.\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Minecraft 26.3 support\n- Six dedicated builds from 1.21.11 through 26.3\n- Real jump-event detection instead of key polling\n- Combat-only Jump Reset Indicator activation\n- Early, perfect, late, and missed timing feedback\n- Updated translations and consistent module naming\n- Dependency and performance cleanup across all supported versions\n\nExisting HudFabric settings remain compatible and are migrated automatically."
