			"notes": "## HudFabric 1.0.5\n\n- Accurate left/right CPS tracking, including fast clicking and autoclickers\n- Jump Reset feedback now triggers only during real player combat and ignores normal jumping or unrelated damage\n- Two armor durability styles: panel and clean vanilla hotbar slots\n- Individually movable armor slots, improved offhand spacing and reliable offhand rendering\n- Crosshair Indicator integration and refined crosshair designs\n- Reworked module settings, per-module colors, draggable scrollbars and HUD editor controls\n- Improved effect timers, server transitions, large scoreboards and long-duration formatting\n- Safe configuration migration preserves existing 1.0.4 settings\n\nSupports Minecraft 1.21.11, 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2 and 26.2."
		},
