			"notes": "✨ A cleaner, fully modular HUD update.\n\n- Redesigned module settings with colors inside each module\n- Improved scrolling, draggable scrollbars, and overlap-safe layouts\n- Added and refined CPS with editor scaling and positioning\n- Expanded crosshair settings and restored crosshair colors\n- Fixed large scoreboard rendering and long potion-effect durations\n- Fixed effect state when switching worlds or servers\n- Improved effect icons and remaining-time display\n- Added automatic settings migration between HudFabric updates\n- Added a hotbar-style armor HUD mode inspired by the familiar vanilla slot layout\n- Added bar, number, percentage, side, and low-durability warning options\n- Auto Respawn and Auto Reconnect refinements\n\nFull source and privacy-safe release history: https://github.com/abcnova/HudFabric"
